"psychic energy" message.  At that point, I suddenly get a lot more
questions than "should I explore the left or right branch first?".


How many projectiles will it take to kill?  How far can I throw?

Will it stop, pick them up and throw them back?

Where's a suitably long, straight corridor?  Should I dig one?

How close do I need to get to lure it into my chosen corridor?

Should I throw while levitating, so I can fire once and retreat in the
same turn?

Do I need the brainfood, and am I too full to eat it?


